`Cas::exact_reading_map(context,(inputs,outputs),coefficients,offsets,budget)` retains Real scalar expressions as the native homogeneous matrix `[T,d;0,1]`. `Cas::constant_reading_map` imports `ExactConstant` entries through the same producer, including exact degree scale `Pi/180`. `compose_reading_maps` constructs ordered native matrix multiplication. These expressions extend the rational coefficient map fragment; there is one inverse algorithm and one checked matrix identity path, with rational import and export at its boundary. `ExactAffineMap::expression` exposes the original matrix syntax for equality, replay and retained identity.

The native matrix branch of `poly.jets-equal` rebuilds explicit Real matrices and ordered matrix products over the existing scalar rational-function coefficient algebra. Every matrix leaf must retain an explicit coefficient definition: products of bare declared matrix symbols retain `ReadingDefinition`, while unequal supported coefficient maps return `ReadingMismatch`. Scalar products commute only within an individual contraction. Original endpoints retain every denominator and definition, including invalid terms beneath zeros. Normalized inverse entries are proposals until the original matrix identity is checked. A `CheckedMapInverse` retains its inverse, determinant and two `VerifiedWitness` values; keep both witnesses with the map. `nonsingularity` checks `det(T)/d=1` and retains `d != 0`; the checker recomputes the determinant by exact formal elimination, independently of the producer's signed-minor algorithm. An internal formal pivot introduces no family premise. `witness` checks the complete inverse identity. Positivity and nonzero assumptions remain qualified witness hypotheses, and dropping one changes the expected replay judgment. The determinant producer uses bounded finite permutations and signed minors; budget exhaustion is a resource refusal, never a singularity claim.

Every new producer uses the caller's cumulative ledger and the store's intersected ceilings. Canonical coefficient reconstruction, ordered contraction, determinant permutations, normalization, condition derivation, checking and witness encoding retain their ordinary charges. Temporary coefficient arrays reserve payload before allocation, and failed map construction or inversion rolls back all graph records while retaining spent Work. Rational composition and affine reading proofs retain exact resource-boundary tests.

